OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny mist and fog patches
OL,6,Fquickly clearing to leave a mostly dry
OL,7,Fday, albeit with the chance of a few
OL,8,Ffleeting light showers. Some sunshine
OL,9,Fis likely, but cloud will build for
OL,10,Fmany, especially inland. Breezy
OL,11,Fsouthwesterly winds. Rather warm.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FStaying mostly dry this
OL,14,Fevening but thickening cloud may bring
OL,15,Foccasional light showery rain and
OL,16,Fdrizzle at times overnight. Rather
OL,17,Fwindy in coastal regions and remaining
OL,18,Fvery mild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
