OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FLargely cloudy and quite
OL,6,Fbreezy with some light showers but
OL,7,Foccasional brighter spells are
OL,8,Fpossible. A very mild day and feeling
OL,9,Funseasonably warm in any sunshine.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRain on
OL,12,FThursday night, then breezy and colder
OL,13,Fon Friday with sunny spells and
OL,14,Fpossible showers. Settled and largely
OL,15,Fdry thereafter with some sunshine and
OL,16,Fcold, locally frosty nights.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
